{{Elections in Illinois}}

The '''2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Illinois''' were held on November 8, 2022, to elect the 17 [[United States House of Representatives|U.S. representatives]] from [[Illinois]], one from each of the state's 17 [[Illinois's congressional districts|congressional districts]] (reduced from 18 in the [[2020 United States redistricting cycle|redistricting cycle]] following the [[2020 United States census]]).<ref>{{cite web |title=How redistricting will shape Illinois for the next decade |url=https://www.politico.com:443/interactives/2022/congressional-redistricting-maps-by-state-and-district/illinois/ |access-date=2022-05-12 |website=Politico |language=en}}</ref> The elections coincided with the [[2022 United States Senate election in Illinois|2022 U.S. Senate race in Illinois]], as well as [[2022 United States House of Representatives elections|other elections]] to the House of Representatives, other [[2022 United States Senate elections|elections]] to the [[United States Senate]] and various [[2022 United States elections#State elections|state]] and [[2022 United States elections#Local elections|local elections]]. On November 23, 2021, Governor [[J. B. Pritzker]] signed the Illinois Congressional Redistricting Act of 2021, which established the new boundaries of the districts, into law.<ref>{{cite news|last=Miller|first=Rich|title=Pritzker signs congressional remap bill|date=November 23, 2021|newspaper=[[Capitol Fax]]|access-date=November 23, 2021|url=https://capitolfax.com/2021/11/23/pritzker-signs-congressional-remap-bill/|archive-date=November 23, 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211123210714/https://capitolfax.com/2021/11/23/pritzker-signs-congressional-remap-bill/|url-status=live}}</ref> ''[[FiveThirtyEight]]'' ranked Illinois as the most [[gerrymandered]] Congressional map drawn by Democrats following 2022 redistricting.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Rakich |first1=Nathaniel |last2=Chow |first2=Tony |title=Illinois May Be The Worst Democratic Gerrymander In The Country |url=https://fivethirtyeight.com/videos/illinois-may-be-the-worst-democratic-gerrymander-in-the-country/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220506150548/https://fivethirtyeight.com/videos/illinois-may-be-the-worst-democratic-gerrymander-in-the-country/ |url-status=dead |archive-date=May 6, 2022 |website=[[FiveThirtyEight]] |publisher=FiveThirtyEight |date=6 May 2022}}</ref>
